---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Eversales">
  <main class="bg-slate-50 pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="spotlight-item bg-white rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-16 shadow-sm transition-all duration-500">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-600 space-y-8">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. Acceptance</h2>
            <p>By accessing EverSales, you agree to comply with these terms. Our "Services" refer to all content, digital tools, accelerators, and training architectures provided through this platform.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. Use of Site</h2>
            <p>You agree to use this site only for lawful purposes. You are prohibited from attempting to bypass our security systems or reverse-engineer our sales architecture methodologies.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. Results Disclaimer</h2>
            <p>Any revenue growth figures, performance metrics, or "AI-Augmentation" benefits mentioned on this site are based on previous performance and engineering standards. Individual results vary and depend on the full implementation of the EverSales infrastructure.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">4. Modifications</h2>
            <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time to reflect changes in our service offerings or legal requirements. Your continued use of the site after such changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <script>/* Spotlight logic shared across pages */</script>
</Layout>